s.png", "id": "1232311671870639", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820523_1232311675203972_5305435556231081087_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s3jDj8W3hV0Q7kNvwEKMJEg&_nc_oc=AdrvSEGsghcConlVKb4SJa_CVbIr1RZY50R6sj-B8tOkOyPs9tqhhb4utnV_8PyM0Y4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQwwfDLf73L5MX1QHirWSuPxWAyyad9lAWpklgqL2xxhA&oe=6AFF2C36"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "491824711_3121170774703660_5309438630905965778_n.png", "id": "746833127759947", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_746833131093280_3531113835455490555_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cL4P0-5hlc4Q7kNvwEGyGOq&_nc_oc=Ado2VmXmi_YYlNd-6So1P42wJzYqqjiVFEYaujKhOFFqFfPHNWjbP5t4qSEph52xGeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQkCbfiGKEhi2Wjn-rFSK13pVZ6ca3lVpLu7G53Sb7PCQ&oe=6AFF14FD"}, "display_name": "MATH-A-MOLE", "keywords": [], "long_description": "MATH-A-MOLE is a fast-paced and fun educational game where you solve math problems by whacking the correct mole! Equipped with a virtual hammer, you'll enter a colourful arena filled with popping moles, each holding a possible answer. Quick thinking and accurate math skills are your keys to racking up points and beating the clock. Perfect for kids and learners of all ages, MATH-A-MOLE combines arcade action with brain training to make learning math exciting and interactive!", "short_description": "Sharpen your math skills in a fast-paced, arcade-style challenge! In MATH-A-MOLE, you use a virtual hammer to whack the mole with the correct answer to each math problem. It's a fun and energetic way to practice addition, subtraction, and more, perfect for learners of all ages!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B3KNESmF2S8bFCdivo6S0UMBaS68peIqZfzvLoRR6-8/edit?usp=shar